<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 16.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 16.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on October 15.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Yield     Close</p>
<p>1  Prime Credit Tr	 10.21     0.96</p>
<p>2  Indu Property	    9.78     0.93</p>
